This distribution contains third-party Go modules. Their copyright and
license notices are retained by their respective projects. A versioned
inventory and the applicable licenses are provided in:

  * THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
  * SBOM.spdx.json

The most important runtime components are:

  * pgx and related modules (MIT) for PostgreSQL access
  * modernc.org/sqlite and supporting modules (BSD-3-Clause) for SQLite
  * go-sql-driver/mysql (MPL-2.0) for MySQL connectivity
  * go-ora (MIT) for Oracle connectivity
  * golang.org/x packages (BSD-3-Clause)

No model weights or training/evaluation datasets are bundled with this
repository or its gateway binary. Model services are selected and called at
runtime by the operator. See MODEL_CARD.md for that boundary and the model
provider license/terms obligations.

The Docker build uses the official Go Alpine build image and the Google
Distroless static nonroot runtime image. Container base-image packages are
not Go modules and should be inventoried from the final image for each
release (for example, with Syft). SBOM.spdx.json describes the source-built
gateway and its linked Go module dependency closure.

